{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"ae527fef469d242f58c13d306c13b8b0b9e396528c8633896b0fcaab9382f058","ja":"特別なファンサービス","zh":"特别的粉丝福利","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2c01208d48cfdb8a662ea6e1f36e968aa70f563d82b3ff0ce9fd47cf865cfa03","ja":"琴葉がチャラ男を演じたボイスドラマが\n公開された翌日……","zh":"琴叶饰演轻浮男的有声广播剧\n公开后的第二天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ea6d445d8d8e426454eecbd8b4d20b3a42a5bb9af3c909c99f6b25b4e9b3d6ea","ja":"「……ウソ、マジ！？　ヤバい……めっちゃ\n嬉しいんだけど！　あ～……大切に、します」","zh":"「……骗人，真的假的！？不得了……我超\n开心的！啊～……我会，好好珍惜的」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3716c0af00d4a2838e1727edfe47fcacd58dcc9b8601c1ff8b2386bd1305a55a","ja":"ふおぉぉ～っ！　何度聞いても最高です！\n照れボイス、尊すぎます～～～っ！","zh":"呜哦哦～！　无论听多少次都太棒了！\n害羞语音，简直太尊了～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8d979804eb7ea44aa33b97ec93b27b9eaa689b6df08eb0c85c755824dfae0085","ja":"ちょ、ちょっと亜利沙！\n控え室でその音量は……！","zh":"等、等一下亚利沙！\n在休息室放这么大声……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4fb9467f6ff6875349e2747ab0a2bd21e2519d0673377db325683de33ea3e498","ja":"はっ！　す、すみません、つい……！\n少し小さくしてから、引き続き楽しみますっ！","zh":"啊！对、对不起，我不由自主就……！\n我会把声音调小一点，然后继续享受的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e11f6bf8880db3040c541ab09f7aac86e1ac027574401520f77c6b0e4861d0e9","ja":"……ふふ。まあ、\n何度も聞いてくれるのはありがたいけど。","zh":"……呵呵。不过，\n你能听这么多次我也很高兴就是了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5391248c86a26cdd11bc7a1e68d0ac70db988b19ae2093ce8dedc24b3bcdaa2a","ja":"はい！　何度聞いても\n新しい胸キュンがありますから！","zh":"好的！无论听多少次，\n都能让人重新心动呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e3472ed64b39fe2640f95fafd2230e463fb76f8a1b18715c6499fb4d1ae305fd","ja":"そんなに？","zh":"有那么多？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e510294b49210760387aff50be5a6aed6bbf7c81dd289f858516861387c10dac","ja":"それはもう！\n琴葉ちゃんの演技は、最っっ高～～～～ですっ！","zh":"那是当然！\n琴叶的演技，真是太太太～～～～棒了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"763a651f5f46c2d0de4993237208ae599b1b342000fc34aa30054c5f8666a235","ja":"そ、そっか。そこまで気に入ってくれてるなら、\nうん……今回だけ、『特別』ってことで……。","zh":"这、这样啊。既然你都这么喜欢了，\n嗯……仅限这次，算作“特别破例”吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ccbe8f867265bf6b228da11819bf06b89addbf072103fe69f47da951d47b04bb","ja":"「キミがいないと、マジでダメっぽいわ、オレ。\nだからずっと……そばにいてくれない？」","zh":"“要是没有你，我真的一下子就不行了。\n所以……能一直留在我身边吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c26245eec7245bc1cd2f42131ae5f8b24325c9b75926459e26d5d54effcd6975","ja":"はうあっ！？\nま、まさか……お、推しのアドリブ限定ボイス……！？","zh":"哈哇！？\n难、难道是……本、本命推的即兴限定语音……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4b7622395f40e662b813c3890ebc97a2e86d0d3f8ad4760c567c162d1494dcad","ja":"どこまでも付いていきま～～～す！\n琴葉ちゃ～～～～んっ！","zh":"无论天涯海角我都跟定你啦～～～！\n琴叶～～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1546.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"04c100583c475410c403703f8e609f22d36c45a665b8647315fc6bfc917649b3","ja":"もう、亜利沙ったら、またそんなに叫んで……。\nでも、喜んでくれてよかった。ふふっ。","zh":"真是的，亚利沙又叫得那么大声……\n不过，她能高兴真是太好了。呵呵。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
